# QCAD 3.33.1 SVG 导出里的实体类型注释（证明标注是标注对象）
# 生成命令: dwg2svg samples/<file>.dxf

== spacer-20x32x12.05-dxf-2000-1x1.svg
   2 <!-- Circle -->
   2 <!-- Diametric Dimension -->
   5 <!-- Line -->
   1 <!-- Polyline -->
   1 <!-- Rotated Dimension -->

== spacer-20x32x12.05-dxf-2000-1x2.svg
   2 <!-- Circle -->
   2 <!-- Diametric Dimension -->
   5 <!-- Line -->
   1 <!-- Polyline -->
   1 <!-- Rotated Dimension -->

== spacer-20x32x12.05-dxf-r12-1x1.svg
   2 <!-- Circle -->
  29 <!-- Line -->
   4 <!-- Polyline -->

# 对照：R12 完全没有 Dimension，2000 有 1 个 Rotated + 2 个 Diametric
